\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The Spirit breathes upon the word,
\par And brings the truth to sight;
\par Precepts and promises afford
\par A sanctifying light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. A glory gilds the sacred page,
\par Majestic, like the sun:
\par It gives a light to every age;
\par It gives, but sorrows none.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The hand that gave it still supplies
\par The gracious light and heat;
\par His truths upon the nations rise;
\par They rise, but never set.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Let everlasting thanks be Thine
\par For such a bright display
\par And makes a world of darkness shine
\par With beams of heavenly day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. My soul rejoices to pursue
\par The steps of Him I love,
\par Till glory breaks upon my view
\par In brighter worlds above.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

